{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e8f90647723d04f1","name":"Mission Vao","source":{"id":"source:reference-e8f90647723d04f1","title":"Mission Vao","revision":22513,"timestamp":"2024-09-04T23:43:32Z","sha256":"574c8cb2829d8619a5cf0e7409d30421f89ae84c0517ada52cecd866b48684d4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=22513","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mission%20Vao&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e8f90647723d04f1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hidden Beks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hidden_Beks","referenceId":"reference:b89996cdec30ef22"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Mission Vao is a bright, cheerful, young ",{"tag":"a","children":["Twi'lek"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Twi%27lek","referenceId":"reference:b787e536e15f2960"}," who grows up in the rough Undercity of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"},". Though her skills are less than reputable, she is nonetheless loyal to her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," friend ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zaalbar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zaalbar","referenceId":"reference:7c86261e275387ad"}," and her troublesome brother ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grif Vao"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grif_Vao?action=edit&redlink=1"},". She and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zaalbar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zaalbar","referenceId":"reference:7c86261e275387ad"}," travel with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"}," after they help ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zaalbar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zaalbar","referenceId":"reference:7c86261e275387ad"}," escape slavers on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"},". Her skills prove to be extremely useful, but she is also on a mission of her own- trying to catch up with her brother. She succeeds, only to discover that he was more dishonest than she imagined. She and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"}," succeed in bailing him out of yet another unlikely scheme, before they part ways and she follows ",{"tag":"a","children":["Revan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Revan","referenceId":"reference:9199cff8278e357a"}," in their search for ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Star Forge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Star_Forge"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Mission Vao Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Twi'lek"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Twi%27lek","referenceId":"reference:b787e536e15f2960"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},":"]}," 1; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +10; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href"